  "updated_at": "2026-03-11",
  "bio": "Drawing from the pulsating energy of Wittenberg, Lutherstadt, Denny Täubner is renowned for their mastery in the bold and anarchic 'trashpolka' style, a dynamic blend of high-contrast elements and kinetic designs. Acclaimed for their unwavering professionalism, Denny ensures that each session is an immaculate experience, reflecting the highest standards of the craft in both their stunning artistry and the sterile environment of their studio. Visitors leave with not just a statement piece of body art, but a lasting impression of a truly dedicated artist's commitment to excellence.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Wittenberg, Lutherstadt, Sachsen-anhalt, Germany"
}